  "code_simplified": [
    "Remove GetModuleHandleW, GetProcAddress, function-pointer transmute, and lookup failure branches from every COM free.",
    "Remove get_mix_format_bytes -> Vec copy -> waveformat indirection from the two-scalar device probe; retain one native allocation/free.",
    "Remove iterator-chain collection growth for device IDs; safe Rust reserves once, encodes, and appends the terminator."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Microbenchmarks do not measure complete endpoint activation latency or steady-state rendering throughput.",
    "Unicode fixture reserves a UTF-8 byte bound: peak Rust bytes rise from 208 to 302; total requested bytes fall from 312 to 302 and reallocations fall from one to zero. ASCII peak bytes fall from 160 to 112.",
    "Native COM allocations remain one per format query and are not counted as Rust allocations.",
    "Windows 7 was compile-checked and its legacy interface path was mocked; no Windows 7 hardware runtime was used.",
    "Nightly emits an unused windows-core workspace dependency warning from its standard-library build."
  ],
